       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NUMERICEDITDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 RAW-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0045250.75.
       01 EDITED-AMOUNT PIC $ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
       01 NEGATIVE-AMOUNT PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE -1250.50.
       01 EDITED-NEGATIVE PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99CR.
       01 COUNTER-VALUE PIC 9(6) VALUE 42.
       01 ZERO-SUPPRESSED PIC Z(5)9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE RAW-AMOUNT TO EDITED-AMOUNT
           DISPLAY "EDITED AMOUNT: " EDITED-AMOUNT
           MOVE NEGATIVE-AMOUNT TO EDITED-NEGATIVE
           DISPLAY "EDITED NEGATIVE: " EDITED-NEGATIVE
           MOVE COUNTER-VALUE TO ZERO-SUPPRESSED
           DISPLAY "ZERO SUPPRESSED: " ZERO-SUPPRESSED
           STOP RUN.
